Package: xmonad-log-applet-common
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Breaks:
 xmonad-log-applet (<< 2.90.0-2~)
Replaces:
 xmonad-log-applet (<< 2.90.0-2~)
Description: XMonad log applet for desktop panels - common files
 A panel applet that shows xmonad's workspaces, the icons of the windows
 on each workspace and the title of the focused window. Clicking a
 window's icon activates that window. xmonad sends the information over
 D-Bus; an example xmonad configuration is included.
 .
 This package contains the files shared by the MATE, Xfce and GNOME
 versions: the settings schema, the icon, the documentation and the
 example xmonad configuration.

