Description: XMonad log applet for desktop panels - MATE panel applet
 A panel applet that shows xmonad's workspaces, the icons of the windows
 on each workspace and the title of the focused window. Clicking a
 window's icon activates that window. xmonad sends the information over
 D-Bus; an example xmonad configuration is included.
